{
  "Tap a scene card to open it.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Tap the step you would do first. Then keep tapping steps in order.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Press Space or tap the chest to the beat. Keep the needle in the shaded band.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Tap Start 2-minute round when you are ready.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Tap a card to read it, or tap Practice it to try it.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "New best time.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Scene complete. Check why this order works.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Push faster.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "A little slower.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Keep going. Don't stop.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Round over. Check your rate summary.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Choose Keep them to return, or Clear both to erase the saved records.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "During a game, an adult in the bleachers slumps over and slides to the floor. They don't move when people call their name.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Make sure the scene is safe. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Tap their shoulders and shout \"Are you okay?\"; look for normal breathing for no more than 10 seconds (gasping is not normal breathing). Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Call 911 on speaker and send someone for the AED. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Push hard and fast in the center of the chest, 100 to 120 a minute. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "When the AED arrives, turn it on and follow its voice prompts. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Keep going until help takes over or the person starts to move or breathe normally. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Wait a minute to see if they wake up before calling. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Stop every few compressions to check them. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Your friend suddenly grabs their throat. They can't talk, cough or breathe.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Ask \"Are you choking? Can I help?\". Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Have someone call 911. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Give 5 back blows between the shoulder blades, then 5 abdominal thrusts just above the belly button. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Keep repeating until the object comes out or they can breathe, cough or talk. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "If they stop responding, lower them to the ground and start CPR. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Give them water to wash it down. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Reach blindly into their mouth. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "A classmate cut their forearm on a tool. It's bleeding a lot, and the teacher is across the room.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Put on gloves from the first aid kit. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Press firmly on the wound with a clean cloth or gauze. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "send someone to call 911. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "If blood soaks through, add more cloth on top and keep pressing. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Keep firm pressure until help takes over. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Lift the cloth every few seconds to check. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Take off the soaked cloth and start over. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "A classmate grabs a hot pan handle. Their palm is red and a blister is starting.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Cool the burn under cool running water for at least 10 minutes. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "gently take off rings or anything tight near the burn. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Cover it loosely with a clean, dry, nonstick dressing. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Tell the teacher and school nurse; a burn on the hand should be checked by a health care provider. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Put ice on it. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Pop the blister. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Hot August practice. A teammate is confused, stumbling, and their skin is very hot.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Notice the danger signs: confusion and very hot skin can mean heat stroke, an emergency. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Call 911. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Move them to a cooler place, in the shade or inside. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Cool them fast with cool, wet cloths or a cool bath. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Stay with them until help arrives. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Give them a drink while they're confused. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Let them rest alone in the locker room. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "A student falls to the floor. Their body is stiff and jerking.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Stay calm and stay with them. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Ease them to the floor and move hard or sharp things away. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "start timing the seizure. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Put something soft under their head and gently turn them onto one side. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Call 911 if the seizure lasts longer than 5 minutes. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Stay until they are fully awake, and talk to them calmly. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Hold them down. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
  "Put something in their mouth. Press Enter to place this card.": "qwen3-tts-1.7b-base clone",
